Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.66,0:02:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both involved with Japan Plati?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.79,0:02:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.87,0:02:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.33,0:03:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Misaki talking with you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.63,0:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you at the company visiting Kotobuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.05,0:03:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the cat's out of the bag now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.81,0:03:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're founders.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.89,0:03:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two founded Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.23,0:03:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.15,0:03:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru! You changed your look?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop if it's weird.{change it back?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.20,0:03:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stay this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you had it in you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You look like a lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.17,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.13,0:03:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're they?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right is Acca. Left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.05,0:03:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? Acca's totally hot.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.80,0:03:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And me?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.43,0:03:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a bad apple.{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.64,0:03:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.47,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they were both human?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We still are.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.10,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We abandoned our bodies and kept just our brains.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.98,0:04:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Gross!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.32,0:04:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once young scientific geniuses, now just dummies.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.15,0:04:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you have a lot of questions, but—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.91,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's from Momo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.75,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving us on read?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She got asked out?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.09,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,By a girl again, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.93,0:04:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go up!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.65,0:04:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.44,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.73,0:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls' talk! Girls' talk!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.69,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't they have questions for us?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.03,0:04:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls' talk takes priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Momo!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.59,0:05:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you changed your hairstyle.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.55,0:05:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.63,0:05:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem different today yourself, Momoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.38,0:05:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.68,0:05:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.35,0:05:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares? Tell us the rest!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.73,0:05:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I went on a date.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.23,0:05:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you meet him?! You go to a girls' school.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.90,0:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my follower.{wat} And the first time we met...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.53,0:05:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,he told me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.95,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you what?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.74,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He asked me out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.33,0:05:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky.{That's nice?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.25,0:05:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's over! There won't be a next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.42,0:05:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he different on the date?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.01,0:05:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.92,0:05:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the first time a guy ever asked me out,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.10,0:05:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so I dressed as girly as I could.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.98,0:06:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bare legs and stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.98,0:06:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I got to the meeting place,{I got there}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.02,0:06:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,he looked horrified.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.81,0:06:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Horrified? What for?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.11,0:06:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He thought I was a boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.41,0:06:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's the funny thing that happened to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.33,0:06:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't laugh at that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.62,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh. I'll feel worse otherwise.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.83,0:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,2880)}Oh, here's lunch. I made my specialty, so eat up.{funky fade}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.31,0:06:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.93,0:06:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ohto?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.48,0:06:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true you're quitting your job here?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.90,0:06:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I think I've figured out a way \Nto make a living as an artist.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not running away?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Running?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.08,0:07:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.{Nevermind.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.13,0:07:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hold a small solo exhibition.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come see it if you like.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.85,0:07:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do, Leon?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,are you a boy
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,or a girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.79,0:07:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be nice, not judging by appearance.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.64,0:08:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be with someone I like.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kurita Kaoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.70,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.08,0:08:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it'd be embarrassing to talk more feminine.{embarassing?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.91,0:08:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you look plenty feminine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.38,0:08:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you playing up the contrast?{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.05,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... Sawaki Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.68,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, call me whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.81,0:08:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.27,0:08:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.89,0:08:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoe?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.48,0:08:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.94,0:08:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.90,0:08:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tall, cool beauties like you are totally my type.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.40,0:09:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh okay, I get it. You don't care if I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Haruka.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.29,0:09:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.62,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a girl, but she said she loves me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.87,0:09:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, a lesbian?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.25,0:09:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.63,0:09:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That crocodile's something else.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.31,0:09:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Panic.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.48,0:09:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So, his name's Panic.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.65,0:09:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you full?{ugh}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.87,0:09:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.75,0:09:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kaoru?{honorifics plz}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.22,0:10:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.97,0:10:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.72,0:10:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute and fair.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost too fragile to hug.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.02,0:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What idiot could believe that you're a boy "on the inside"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.78,0:10:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoe!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.37,0:10:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you after Kaoru, too?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.54,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My kendo club advisor.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to him for advice.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}thought {\i0}he was a good teacher,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.63,0:10:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but he pushed me down in the boardinghouse and...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.64,0:10:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I... got pregnant.{........}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.98,0:10:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt bad for the baby, but I... I...{......}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.07,0:11:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm strong!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So am I!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.16,0:11:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You won his trust, then exploited him.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.25,0:11:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate cowards like you more than anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.63,0:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're after Kaoru too, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.55,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stab you and your disgusting jealousy!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.35,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.72,0:11:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you could get on top of me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.90,0:11:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill any man who makes passes at my Kaoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.03,0:11:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut off the legs they walk {up }on \Nand the mouths they talk with!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.20,0:11:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Momo? Is she all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.16,0:12:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always worrying about other people,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.42,0:12:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you don't focus on your \Nown fight, you'll get tripped up.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.51,0:12:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.47,0:12:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you do it to avoid thinking about your own problems?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because a painting I did here won a prize.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.40,0:12:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The one of Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.82,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the way in the back.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.20,0:12:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want you to see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.67,0:12:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some confidence, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.30,0:12:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the cutest girl I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.14,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.47,0:12:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.81,0:13:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy...{hmm}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.19,0:13:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,a girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.59,0:13:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.38,0:13:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.31,0:13:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.07,0:13:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.95,0:13:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to teach you all over again!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.08,0:14:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I'm reborn, I'll be the one to protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.63,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all girls want to be protected.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.93,0:14:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.93,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get a choice about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.89,0:14:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lovely girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.11,0:14:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're a brave boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{Do}You mind younger guys?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.66,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends how much younger.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.50,0:14:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make a reservation.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.29,0:14:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get a boyfriend until I see you again.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.79,0:14:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.84,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.03,0:15:19.03,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.24,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.24,0:15:21.16,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.16,0:15:22.24,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.33,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.33,0:15:24.41,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.46,0:15:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.22,0:15:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoe?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.06,0:15:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.98,0:15:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But her statue's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.78,0:15:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. It's really over!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoe won't be coming anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.13,0:16:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.96,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She cleared the game?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.92,0:16:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.38,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Work hard so that you can follow in her footsteps.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning Momoe got out first?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.18,0:16:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She could have told us.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.97,0:16:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.94,0:16:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I remembered something I have to do after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.23,0:16:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to go!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.65,0:16:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "after all"?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.99,0:16:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go for ramen?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.33,0:16:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.70,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting late.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... stuff with everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.93,0:17:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.64,0:17:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.43,0:17:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.69,0:17:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you message me every 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.19,0:17:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm off.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.72,0:17:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Me—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.47,0:17:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's different?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.55,0:17:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you. But you, grown up.{scratch the you?}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.23,0:17:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me... grown up?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it looks like someone?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.07,0:18:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.{Exactly/That's right/Right}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.45,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, you'll be a wonderful, \Nadult woman like your mother.{scratch the "adult"}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.00,0:18:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind, strong, and beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.50,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You love my mom, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.21,0:18:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. With all my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're her daughter...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.31,0:18:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so you should have faith in yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.40,0:18:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.44,0:18:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.03,0:18:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Koito die?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.62,0:18:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plans may end up going off-course.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.87,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.92,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To confront Thanatos, we need \Nwarriors of Eros, his polar opposite.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.67,0:19:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Momoe go back there for us?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.68,0:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.89,0:19:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows it now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The overwhelming fear of death.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.61,0:19:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.70,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell teacher on you.{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.95,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. You completed your mission.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl came back to life.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.41,0:19:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.16,0:19:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to let you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.21,0:19:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for the way you've \Nrisked your life for friendship.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.55,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, Frill will get mad at me if she finds out.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill?{Brain?}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.22,0:19:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pain, so I'll cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.97,0:19:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die here?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.86,0:20:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I figured.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.95,0:20:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.79,0:20:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I guess I'll settle for this thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.55,0:20:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They say crocodile tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Momo?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.17,0:21:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(3000,0)}I can't sleep. I can't sleep. I can't \Nsleep. I can't sleep. I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.88,0:21:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep. I can't sleep. {Don't fall asleep.}{Can't fall asleep.}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.48,0:22:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
